# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Material fetched from the speedtest.net production site.
#
# The gauge numeral face (public/fonts/gaugemono.woff2) is committed, so a clone
# renders exactly like the reference. The site's own bundle and gradient rasters
# stay out of the tree; `npm run fetch-assets` pulls them back for re-running the
# sampling pipeline. Derived, factual artefacts (colour samples, metrics,
# screenshots) are committed.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
